## Research status

Self-excluded (`.md.excluded`): no verified public benchmark numbers were found for the exact model identity `qwen3.8-omni-flash` / `qwen/qwen-3.8-omni-flash` in official Alibaba Cloud Model Studio documentation fetched during this run. Official pages provide product capabilities, context limits, pricing, and API access details, but do not publish benchmark scores (e.g. GPQA, SWE-bench, TAU-bench, MMMU, LiveCodeBench, MRCR/RULER, etc.) for this specific model ID. Per task rules, a scored findings file is not created when zero verified public benchmark numbers are available.

## Verified model facts (non-benchmark)

- **Name:** Qwen 3.8 Omni Flash (`qwen3.8-omni-flash`)
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud Model Studio inference service. Non-real-time access via Chat Completions or Responses API; real-time variant `qwen3.8-omni-flash-realtime` via WebSocket/WebRTC/AOQ.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, audio, and video input; text output (non-real-time). Real-time variant supports text/streaming audio/video input and text/audio output.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000-token context window; maximum output length 131,072 tokens. Non-thinking max input 991,808 tokens; thinking max input 983,616 tokens (Alibaba Cloud Model Studio docs).
- **Capabilities:** Function/custom tool calling, thinking mode enabled by default with adjustable reasoning effort, web search support, automatic implicit context caching and Responses session caching, multichannel audio input support (docs state).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11, Alibaba Cloud Model Studio pricing):** International/Singapore listed pricing for `qwen3.8-omni-flash` shows $0.15 per million input tokens, $0.016 per million cache-hit input tokens, and $0.47 per million output tokens. Real-time `qwen3.8-omni-flash-realtime` pricing is listed separately (e.g. Beijing: $0.212/M text-image-video input, $0.848/M audio input, $0.636/M text output, $1.696/M audio output; Singapore differs). Rates may vary by region/deployment and promotions.

